          {
            "start_line": 51,
            "end_line": 55,
            "line_count": 5,
            "preview": "// First read: ask for 2 bytes, get the first 2 (0xa, 0xb); the rest of the buffer is untouched. assertEquals(2, stream.read(buffer, 0, 2)); assertEquals(0xa, buffer[0]);"
